{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"powder_mill","model_identifier":"powder_mill","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# powder_mill\n\nPowder mill: a small isolated stone building with very thick walls and a light timber roof (so a blast goes upward), a big edge-runner grinding wheel in the yard, and powder barrels marked with a red band.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -52..59, y 0..101, z -64..53 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 46, construction_0 29, construction_33 34, construction_66 39, ruined 33 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- mill house: 72 x 104 x 64 centred at x 0, z 20\n- grinding bed: 40 x 32 x 40 at z -44\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `powder_mill_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `powder_mill_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_powder_mill` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 4.0 | loop | `runner` edge-runner stone rolls round the bed once per 4 s. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -17)\n- `slot_work` at (-30, 0, -44)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -20)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Light roof: thin grey planks on a shallow pitch (22 u rise) over 8 u thick stone walls (inner shell plus outer skin).\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"mill_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-34.0,0.0,-10.0],"to":[34.0,3.0,50.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[152.0,292.0,220.0,295.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,295.0,60.0,298.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[152.0,292.0,220.0,295.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,295.0,60.0,298.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[181.0,0.0,249.0,60.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[181.0,0.0,249.0,60.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"07981550-ca74-563a-af52-7816f209c407"},{"name":"mill_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.0,3.0,-8.0],"to":[32.0,79.0,-4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[53.0,0.0,117.0,76.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[165.0,0.0,169.0,76.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[53.0,0.0,117.0,76.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[165.0,0.0,169.0,76.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,288.0,64.0,292.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,288.0,64.0,292.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"07e9ee4c-c0d7-5b92-bd61-6641d23dcb82"},{"name":"mill_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.0,3.0,44.0],"to":[32.0,79.0,48.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[53.0,0.0,117